  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC088">
          <l/>mutaṉmu ṉaivariṟ kaṇṇeṉ vēṟṟumai<l/>
          <l>ciṉaimuṉ varuta ṟeḷḷi teṉpa.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/70/mode/1up">70</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ic cūttiram eṉṉutaliṟṟō veṉiṉ, ituvum ataṟkē puṟaṉaṭai yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        urai: 
mutaṟ poruṭku iraṇṭāvatu varumē yeṉiṉ, ciṉaipporuṭkaṇ ēḻāvatu varutal teḷivuṭaittu eṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        varalāṟu:
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Ilam-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭukkaṭ kuṟaittāṉ’</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
        eṉa varum. ‘teḷḷitu’ eṉṟataṉāl,
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Ilam-cit2">
        <l>‘yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ’</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉalumām. (5)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n92/mode/1up">89</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n92/mode/1up">89</ref>.</p>
    <p>i-ḷ. ammutaṟciṉaikkiḷavikkaṇ, mutaṟcoṉmuṉ aikāravēṟṟumai varin, ciṉaicoṉmuṉ kaṇṇeṉṉum vēṟṟumai varutaṟeḷḷitu. e-ṟu.</p>
    <p>u-m.</p> 
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Cena-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭiṉkaṭkuṟaittāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <p>teḷḷiteṉṟataṉāṉ, yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ eṉac ciṟupāṉmai aikāravēṟṟumaiyum varumeṉpatām.</p>
      <p>ciṉaikkiḷavikkaṇ mayakkamuṇarttukiṇṟa cūttirattiṭaik "kaṉṟaluñcelavum" eṉṉuñcūttiram vaittateṉṉaiyeṉiṉ;- aiyuṅkaṇṇumeṉpatu atikārattāṉ varac cūttirañcuruṅkumākaliṉ, "ciṉainilaikkiḷavikku" eṉṉñcūttirattiṉpiṉ ataṉai vaittāreṉpatu.</p>
      </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Nacciṉārkkiṉiyar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Irāma. Kōvintacāmipiḷḷai</persName> 1997, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n139/mode/1up">111</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n140/mode/1up">112</ref>.</p>
      <p>
itu, poruṇmayakka muṇarttukiṉṟatu.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.) 
mutal muṉaivariṉ ― ammutaṟciṉaik kiḷavik kaṇ mutaṟcoṉmuṉ ṉiraṇṭām vēṟṟumai variṉ, ciṉai muṉ kaṇṇeṉ vēṟṟumai varutaṟeḷḷiteṉpa ― ciṉaic coṉmuṉ kaṇ eṉ vēṟṟumai varutal teḷḷitu eṉṟu kūṟuvar, pulavareṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
(u-m)
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭiṉkaṇ kuṟaittāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
itu, poruṇ mayakkam teḷḷiteṉṟataṉāṉ
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit2">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa vaikāram varutalum, muṉṉarkkūṟiya vellām paṇpun toḻilum poruṭ ṭoṭarcciyum paṟṟi varutaluṅ koḷka.      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit3">
        <l>maṇiyatu niṟattaik keṭuttāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit4">
        <l>maṇiyai niṟattiṉkaṭ keṭuttāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit5">
        <l>maṇiyai niṟattaik keṭuttāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa muṟkūṟiyatu mivaiyum, oru toṭariṉ iraṇṭurupu mayaṅkaliṉ urupu mayakkam.
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit6">
        <l>talaimakaṉatu celavai yaḻuṅku vittal</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit6">
        <l>talaimakaṉaic celaviṉ kaṇ aḻuṅku vittal</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit6">
        <l>talaimakaṉaic celavai yaḻuṅku vittal</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit6">
        <l>cāttaṉai nūlai yōtu vittāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Nacc-cit6">
        <l>yāṟṟai nīrai vilakkiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉavarum ivai mūṉṟu murupu mayakkam.  <num xml:lang="en">(5)</num>
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Teyvaccilaiyār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">1929, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n79/mode/1up">72</ref>.</p>
    </body>
    <p>
      ituvum iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum oru poruṭkaṇ nikaḻvatōr vēṟupāṭu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
    </p>
    <p>
      i-ḷ:― 
      mutalum ciṉaiyum cēravaruñ coṟku, mutaṟkaṇ atu variṉ ciṉaikku ai varum, mutaṟ kaṇ ai variṉ ciṉaik kaṇ kaṇ varutal teḷiyappaṭṭatu eṉṟu colluvar pulavar. e-ṟu. mayakkam aṉṟu eṉṟavāṟām.
    </p>
    <p>
      u-m:―
    </p>
    <lg xml:id="TolC088-Tey-cit1">
      <l>yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ;</l>
    </lg>
    <lg xml:id="TolC088-Tey-cit2">
      <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭiṉkaṇ kuṟaittāṉ</l>
    </lg>
  <p>
eṉa varum.
  </p>
  <p>
      ‘kaṇ eṉ vēṟṟumai ciṉaimuṉvarutal teḷḷitu’ eṉavē teḷḷitaṉṟic ciṟupāṉmai ai varutalum koḷḷappaṭum.
  </p>
    <p>
      u-m:―
  </p>
    <lg xml:id="TolC088-Tey-cit3">
      <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ.</l>
    </lg>
    <p>
    [4]
    </p>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kallāṭaṉār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Cuntaramūrtti</persName> 1964, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/83/mode/1up">84</ref>.</p>
      <p>
eṉ - eṉiṉ, itaṟkum akkaruttu okkum.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.)
mutaṟkaṇṇē iraṇṭām vēṟṟumai variṉ ēḻām vēṟṟumai ciṉaikkaṇṇē varutal viḷaṅkiṟṟu eṉṟu colluvar pulavar, (e-ṟu.)
      </p>
      <p>
        (e-ṭu.) 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭiṉkaṇ kuṟaittāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit2">
        <l>cāttaṉaik kaṇṇiṉkaṇ kuttiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
       eṉavarum.
      </p>
      <p>
        teḷḷitu eṉṟataṉāl ciṟupāṉmai iraṇṭāvatu tāṉēyum varappeṟum. aḵtu
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit3">
        <l>yāṉaiyaik kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit4">
        <l>cāttaṉaik kaṇṇaik kuttiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
         eṉak koḷka.
      </p>
      <p>
        ivaṟṟuḷ mutal ciṉaip poruṭkuk kaṇṇurupiṉait toṭarntu kūṟumvaḻi iraṇṭāvataṉōṭu oppac ceyappaṭuporuṭkaṇ ēḻāvatu vantavāṟu kaṇṭu koḷka.
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit5">
        <l>maṇiyatu niṟattaik keṭuttāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit6">
        <l>maṇiyai niṟattaik keṭuttāṉ:</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
        itu paṇpu.
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit7">
        <l>talaimakaṉatu celavai aḻuṅkuvittal,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit8">
        <l>talaimakaṉaic celaviṉkaṇ aḻuṅkuvittal,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit9">
        <l>talaimakaṉaic celavai aḻuṅkuvittal.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
         itu toḻil. piṟavum aṉṉa.
      </p>
      <p>
        ivvāṟu mūṉṟu mūṉṟurupu vārātu, oru poruḷatu iraṇṭāvataṉ toṭarccipaṟṟi iraṇṭāvatu tāṉē varuvaṉavum koḷka.
      </p>
      <p>
(e-ṭu.) 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit10">
        <l>cāttaṉai nūlai ōtuvittal.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC088-Kal-cit11">
        <l>yāṟṟai nīrai vilakkiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
        eṉpaṉapōlvaṉa. piṟavum aṉṉa.	(5)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
